/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (   Each day, the irresponsible management of waste at the landfill can be observed. The fence intended to contain the refuse was inadequately maintained, permitting trash to escape and scatter across fields and roads. Such issue is prevalent in many areas around the globe, and after contemplating the problem and considering various potential solutions, our team has ultimately selected the most effective option: the mass production of user-friendly waste sorting devices.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (   The primary objective of this project is to promote recycling culture and integrate AI into daily life through the mass production of this device. With adequate support from private individuals and government entities willing to fund and endorse our initiative, it s possible to be made accessible to the public, thereby enhancing the device's popularity and production.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
