/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 107 0 R
/E (   This device may encounter numerous challenges and obstacles during its implementation and widespread adoption, both economic and social in nature. Should this project achieve significant popularity and become a common presence on every street corner, we will confront substantial logistical challenges related to waste removal and collection, alongside the costs associated with staffing the UDPM. Additionally, there may be a reluctance among the population to embrace and adapt to new technologies. Collectively, these issues could considerably complicate the promotion of the device, which is undoubtedly an unfavorable aspect. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
