/P 107 0 R
/E (   The IWSR will be positioned in proximity to retail establishments and/or shopping centers that can supply the device with both network access and power. This arrangement will be established either through a contractual agreement between the retail entity and the company, or ideally, the government will implement a standard for each store, mandating the installation of the IWSR and allocating the requisite funding. Maintenance will be conducted weekly by specialized personnel who will be required to:)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
