219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 111 0 R
/E (   Upon evaluating this option, several drawbacks were identified in the 3D model: the incorporation of five servo drives \(compared to three in the existing device\), a robust motor for conveyor belt movement \(instead of utilizing gravity during the sorting process in the current device\), and two sensors for waste positioning \(fully\) and dimensions \(140x40x100, as opposed to 140x70x15 in the current device\).)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
