<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 114 0 R
/E ( Prior to developing a physical prototype, we designed and evaluated various sorting mechanisms, ultimately selecting the most efficient system. Based on the finalized design, we constructed a full-scale 3D model in Fusion 360, meticulously mirroring the specifications of the actual device, including exact fastener placement and material details. Before assembly, the model underwent extensive testing in a digital environment through physics simulation and kinematic animation, enabling us to optimize the operation of all components beforehand. This engineering methodology ensured the complete functionality of the mechanisms and the superior quality of the final assembly.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
